        <li><strong>Lexington Hotel, the Chicago River and city parks</strong><span>Bags for people experiencing homelessness, with Chancez NFP</span></li>
        <li><strong>Palatine and Hoffman Estates High Schools</strong><span>Weekend meal bags for students, with Blessings in a Backpack</span></li>
        <li><strong>Across Chicagoland</strong><span>Through our partners <a href="https://thenightministry.org/">The Night Ministry</a>, Wayside Cross Ministries and Journeys | The Road Home</span></li>
